    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529020/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1749714586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529020/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1749714586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>This is a free version of the turn-based combat game with rogue-like and deck-building elements Cyber Souls.<br><br>PROLOGUE FEATURES<br><br>3 playable characters<br>3 combat locations<br>20 attack cards<br>20+ skills<br><br>-Turn-based tactical game, will require you to combine a lot of game moments - an attack card, the position of the hero on the playing field, the morality of the hero - everything matters.<br>-Immerse yourself in the world of dark and brutal sci-fi.<br>-Death is not the end. Try again to achieve perfection.<br>-Unlock new heroes, cards, skills and more.<br>-Upgrade cards to build what you think is the best deck to destroy the dark emperor.<br>-An important role is played not only by the deck, but by the place where the card is used - each position gives its own bonus.<br>-At any time, you can resort to blood sacrifice, but be careful - the bonus from it can bring very painful consequences.<br>-The morale system will allow you to more successfully use your deck or, on the contrary, will greatly complicate its use.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529020/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1749714586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529020/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1749714586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>This is a free version of the turn-based combat game with rogue-like and deck-building elements Cyber Souls.<br><br>PROLOGUE FEATURES<br><br>3 playable characters<br>3 combat locations<br>20 attack cards<br>20+ skills<br><br>-Turn-based tactical game, will require you to combine a lot of game moments - an attack card, the position of the hero on the playing field, the morality of the hero - everything matters.<br>-Immerse yourself in the world of dark and brutal sci-fi.<br>-Death is not the end. Try again to achieve perfection.<br>-Unlock new heroes, cards, skills and more.<br>-Upgrade cards to build what you think is the best deck to destroy the dark emperor.<br>-An important role is played not only by the deck, but by the place where the card is used - each position gives its own bonus.<br>-At any time, you can resort to blood sacrifice, but be careful - the bonus from it can bring very painful consequences.<br>-The morale system will allow you to more successfully use your deck or, on the contrary, will greatly complicate its use.",
